cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the preprint below (preferred-citation); cite the repository for the code and benchmark data."
title: "SYM-3: Token-Aware Shared-State Messaging for Agent-to-Agent Communication"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Arifuddin
    given-names: Ahraz
    affiliation: Moissanite Labs
