    note: agent contributor
doi: pending
repository-code: "https://github.com/aska-digital/protean-sym2p"
url: "https://github.com/aska-digital/protean-sym2p"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  SYM-3 is a tokenizer-aware wire encoding family for multi-message agent command
  streams, with decode-sufficient setup accounting, content-addressed refs, and
  reproducible o200k_base benchmarks against JSON, English, TOON, and Agora-style
  baselines. Reference implementation and SPEC-v3 ship in protean-sym2p; Synbios
  forge schema is an example profile only.
keywords:
  - agent-to-agent
  - token optimization
  - messaging protocol
  - sym-3
  - sym-2p
  - reproducible research
